notes:        1600x980 native wgpu screenshot of the FilmTron Editing workspace using GemiTokens Inferno Pixel Glass (Dark)
              chrome (#09080E background, #13111C panel surfaces, #F97316/#EF4444/#F59E0B accents) with strictly neutral
              RGB(24,24,24) Source and Program video monitors, English and Arabic/RTL titles, Effect Controls, Project Bin,
              and multitrack timeline. Procedural demo media only; no Adobe artwork.
